LayerASettings con atomics (cutoff, res, envAmt, LFO rate/depth, ADSR amp).

APVTS con macros: MASTERGAINDB, LAYERALEVELDB, LAYERAMAINCUTOFF, LAYERAMAINRES, LAYERAENVAMT, LAYERALFORATEHZ, LAYERALFODEPTHSEMITONES, LAYERAAMP*.

Listeners APVTS → LayerASettings → engine; nunca APVTS en audio thread.
